# Live USB CDC-ACM LPI2C1/LPI2C2 scan on PVT Stadia Controller (bare-metal DTCM)
# LPI2C1 configured with MCFGR1=/2 prescaler (~200-400 kHz) and BQ2742X GPOUT (GPIO2_28) wake pulse.
# All 5/5 I2C peripherals discovered:
#   bus=1 0x1A = WM8904 audio codec (reg 0x00 = 0x89)
#   bus=1 0x3B = TS3A227E 3.5 mm headset jack switch (reg 0x00 = 0x11, regs 0x00..0x1C)
#   bus=1 0x55 = BQ2742X battery fuel gauge (SOC=100% @ 0x1C=0x0064, V=4323 mV @ 0x04=0x10E3)
#   bus=1 0x6B = BQ25601 battery charger (REG08=0x3C VBUS Good / Charge Done, REG0B=0x11)
#   bus=2 0x30 = LP5562 RGBW ring LED driver (reg 0x00 = 0x40)
BAT soc=100% mv=4323 chg08=3C hid=0x90
I2C SCAN START
